   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Designed specifically for MERIDION, the integrated 904L stainless-steel bracelet transforms the presence of the watch on the wrist, giving it a distinctly integrated sport-chic look . Its design naturally extends the architecture of the case, combining satin-brushed links , polished interlink inserts and polished bevels . This interplay of finishes echoes the contrasting surfaces of MÉRIDION and creates a seamless visual continuity between case and bracelet. The three-blade butterfly deployant clasp , fitted with a spring-blade mechanism, offers smooth opening and closing. It is finished with the VOXEL logo in a combination of polished and sandblasted surfaces , reflecting the same attention to detail found throughout the bracelet. A double push-button quick-change system allows the bracelet to be easily detached from the case without tools. MERIDION can therefore switch effortlessly between steel and the different Alcantara strap configurations depending on the style or occasion. Robust, comfortable and refined, the integrated 904L steel bracelet gives MERIDION a more assertive and sporty expression while preserving the architectural elegance that defines VOXEL.",
