   "description": "MERIDION is VOXEL’s inaugural timepiece, defined by its sculptural decagonal case, metamorphic dial and exclusive 12/24-hour jumping display complication. The Silver Star Dial edition pairs a textured silver dial with a blue central hand, framed by a 41.4 mm case in 904L steel and protected by a domed, anti-reflective sapphire crystal. At 1:00 PM, all hour markers jump simultaneously from a 12-hour to a 24-hour display. At 1:00 AM, they jump back to 12-hour - a mechanical transformation that makes the full 24-hour cycle intuitive and instantly clear. Designed in France. Engineered and assembled in Switzerland. Limited edition of 60 pieces.",
